{"id":923,"date":"2025-08-21T21:20:14","date_gmt":"2025-08-21T19:20:14","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/caves-route-double-kayak\/"},"modified":"2025-12-03T20:55:02","modified_gmt":"2025-12-03T19:55:02","slug":"ruta-de-las-cuevas-kayak-doble","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/en\/ruta-de-las-cuevas-kayak-doble\/","title":{"rendered":"Caves Route Double Kayak"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"923\" class=\"elementor elementor-923 elementor-661\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c332b79 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c332b79\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2087386 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2087386\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-82fa3ac elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"82fa3ac\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Double Kayak Excursion Caves Route - Cala'n Porter<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a035f39 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a035f39\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<article id=\"kayak-doble-ruta-cuevas\" class=\"vm-excursion-card\"><header class=\"vm-excursion-header\">\n<p class=\"vm-excursion-intro\">An outing as a couple or family along the coast with the most sea caves on the island.<\/p>\n<p class=\"vm-excursion-operator\"><strong>Operator:<\/strong> Excursion carried out by a collaborating partner of Voyager Menorca.<\/p>\n\n<\/header><section class=\"vm-excursion-description\">We will paddle along limestone cliffs and enter\u2014when the sea allows\u2014cavities of turquoise waters. An easy, photogenic experience, perfect for those who want to get started in kayaking. \n\n<\/section><section class=\"vm-excursion-block\">\n<h3>What you will see<\/h3>\n<ul>\n \t<li>Stretches of unspoiled coastline with high cliffs and sheltered coves.<\/li>\n \t<li>Sea caves and natural arches; depending on conditions, a short stop for snorkeling in a quiet cove (Cales Coves area).<\/li>\n \t<li><strong>\u201cDouble\u201d format<\/strong>: ideal for 2 + 1.<\/li>\n \t<li><strong>Self-bailing double kayak<\/strong> (very stable and comfortable).<\/li>\n \t<li>Possibility of a third child seat (small children as 3rd occupant; subject to availability).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/section><section class=\"vm-excursion-block\">\n<h3>Duration and schedules<\/h3>\n<ul>\n \t<li><strong>Duration:<\/strong> 3 hours of activity.<\/li>\n \t<li><strong>Departures:<\/strong> morning and afternoon; we assign the best time according to wind and availability (usual references: 09:00, 10:15, 12:00, 16:00, 16:30).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/section><section class=\"vm-excursion-block\">\n<h3>Meeting point<\/h3>\n<strong>Cala en Porter<\/strong> or <strong>Es Canutells<\/strong> (south area). We confirm the pier when booking to choose the most protected section that day. \n\n<\/section><section class=\"vm-excursion-block\">\n<h3>Includes<\/h3>\n<ul>\n \t<li>Self-bailing double kayak, vest, paddles, and waterproof container.<\/li>\n \t<li>Guide throughout the route.<\/li>\n \t<li>Complimentary photo report with action camera.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/section><section class=\"vm-excursion-block\">\n<h3>What to bring<\/h3>\n<ul>\n \t<li>Swimsuit and sun shirt, hat, and sunscreen.<\/li>\n \t<li>Water and a snack, towel, and water shoes.<\/li>\n \t<li>Snorkel mask (recommended). Secure prescription\/sunglasses if you use them. <\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/section><section class=\"vm-excursion-block\">\n<h3>Level and requirements<\/h3>\n<ul>\n \t<li><strong>Difficulty:<\/strong> low (technical) | <strong>Effort:<\/strong> medium.<\/li>\n \t<li><strong>Essential<\/strong> to know how to swim.<\/li>\n \t<li><strong>Age:<\/strong> minors accompanied by an adult; from 14 years old they can paddle in their seat.<\/li>\n \t<li><strong>Main language of the guide:<\/strong> Spanish (support in English depending on the instructor).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/section><section class=\"vm-excursion-block\">\n<h3>Environmental policy<\/h3>\nWe respect the rules of <strong>Red Natura 2000<\/strong>: some sensitive caves are not visited to protect fauna and habitats. Safety and conservation come first. \n\n<\/section><section class=\"vm-excursion-block\">\n <h3>Important notices<\/h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Activity subject to sea and wind conditions. The itinerary may vary for safety. <\/li>\n      <li>Limited places. Material and child seats subject to availability. <\/li>\n      <li>The operation, insurance, and billing correspond to the collaborating partner.<\/li>\n    <\/ul>\n  <\/section>\n<\/article>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-df93b40 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"df93b40\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f91aa69 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"f91aa69\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/ruta-cuevas.webp?fit=800%2C533&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-901\" alt=\"\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\"><\/figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/fig